#: lib/tuist_web/marketing/controllers/marketing_html/home.html.heex:41
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Build, test, and ship software on infrastructure that continuously optimizes performance, removes bottlenecks, and scales with your team."
msgstr "在持續優化效能、消除瓶頸並隨團隊規模擴展的基礎設施上，建構、測試及發佈軟體。"